;;; cauchy-estimates.scm -- THE CIRCLE'S LENGTH, CAUCHY'S ESTIMATES, THE DERIVATIVE FORMULA,
;;; LIOUVILLE AND THE FUNDAMENTAL THEOREM OF ALGEBRA.
;;; (complex-analysis.pdf ch. 3: Prop 3.40 / Cor 3.42 through the coefficients, Prop 3.47 and
;;; Cor 3.48 (Cauchy's estimates, Liouville); ch. 1, 1.5 (the fundamental theorem of algebra).)
;;; Agent CA-3 of week 2 of the October roadmap (scratchpad/triage/WEEK2.md), 2026-10-04.
;;; Built on theorem-library/cauchy-integral-formula.scm (same agent).
;;;
;;; CONTENTS.
;;;  cc-magnitude-i                     |i| = 1
;;;  circle-road-length                 ROAD-LENGTH(CIRCLE-DERIV(c, r), 0, 2 pi) = 2 pi r  (r >= 0)
;;;  cauchy-kernel-constant-magnitude   |1/(2 pi i)| = 1/(2 pi)
;;;  cauchy-estimate-circle             |f| <= M on C(c, r)  =>  |a_k| <= M r^-k for the
;;;                                     coefficients a_k of holomorphic-power-series-disc
;;;  cauchy-estimate-center             ... and |f(c)| <= M (k = 0: the integral formula at c)
;;;  cauchy-coefficients-radius         every 0 <= rho < r lies below CPS-RADIUS of (a_k)
;;;  holomorphic-coefficient-series     f(z) = sum_k g(k) (z - c)^k for a coefficient FUNCTION g
;;;                                     with g(k) = a_k (the shape taylor-coefficients-at reads)
;;;  cauchy-derivative-formula          THE DERIVATIVE FORMULA: on B(c, rho), 0 < rho < r,
;;;                                     f^(k)(c) = k! a_k = k!/(2 pi i) int_C f(w)/(w - c)^(k+1) dw,
;;;                                     f^(k) = NTH-DERIV-ON(CC-NORMED-FIELD, B(c, rho), f|B(c, rho), k)
;;;  cauchy-estimate-derivative         CAUCHY'S ESTIMATES: |f^(k)(c)| <= k! M r^-k
;;;  cie-squeeze                        x <= K / R for every R > R0 (R0, K >= 0)  =>  x <= 0
;;;  bounded-entire-deriv-zero          f entire, |f| <= M  =>  f'(a) = 0 at every a
;;;  liouville                          f entire, |f| <= M  =>  f(z) = f(0) for every z
;;;  polynomial-holomorphic             z |-> sum_{k < j} p(k) z^k is entire
;;;  polynomial-growth-bound            |sum_{k <= j} p(k) w^k| <= (sum_{k <= j} |p(k)|) |w|^j, |w| >= 1
;;;  fundamental-theorem-of-algebra     p(n) /= 0, n >= 1  =>  sum_{k <= n} p(k) z^k = 0 for some z
;;;
;;; THE ROUTES.
;;; * The derivative formula goes through the coefficients (the brief's first option):
;;;   Theorem 3.35 (holomorphic-power-series-disc) gives f as the sum of sum_k a_k (z - c)^k on
;;;   B(c, r); the radius of convergence of (a_k) is at least r (the absolute convergence of
;;;   cauchy-kernel-series-absolute at every |z - c| < r: cauchy-coefficients-radius, the route
;;;   of analytic-at-from-integral-formula); taylor-coefficients-at (Cor 2.14 at a point) then
;;;   reads f^(k)(c) = k! a_k off the series.  The k-th derivative is the tree's NTH-DERIV-ON on
;;;   a ball B(c, rho), rho < r, of the restriction of f: the vocabulary of taylor-coefficients-at.
;;; * Liouville by the notes' route: |f'(a)| = |a_1| <= M / q for the circle of every radius q
;;;   (with the derivative taken on the fixed ball B(a, 1/2)), so f' = 0; then f is constant on
;;;   every ball B(0, R) (alg-zero-deriv-ball).
;;; * THE FUNDAMENTAL THEOREM OF ALGEBRA does not cite Liouville: a polynomial p of degree
;;;   n >= 1 without zeros has the entire reciprocal g = 1/p, and the growth bound gives
;;;   |g| <= K / R on the circle |w| = R for R large, so |g(0)| <= K / R (cauchy-estimate-center,
;;;   the mean-value inequality at the centre), g(0) = 0, against g(0) p(0) = 1.  This is the
;;;   same estimate as Liouville's applied to g at one point, one step shorter than "g is
;;;   bounded, hence constant, hence ..." (which needs |g| bounded on the compact disc as well).
;;;
;;; STATEMENT CHECKS.  (1) THE POLYNOMIAL VOCABULARY.  The tree's polynomials are the ring
;;; POLY(A) = MONALG(A, NN-ADD-MONOID) of finitely supported coefficient sequences
;;; (structure-library/polynomial.scm) with DEG (poly-degree.scm); there is NO evaluation map
;;; from POLY(CC) to functions CC -> CC.  So the theorem is stated, as the brief allows, for
;;; the polynomial FUNCTION given by a coefficient function p in FUN(NN, CC):
;;;   z |-> CC-SERIES-PARTIAL-SUM(k |-> p(k) z^k, n + 1) = sum_{k <= n} p(k) z^k,
;;; the degree n = succ(m) >= 1 with p(n) /= 0 (coefficients beyond n are not read).  An
;;; evaluation map POLY(CC) -> FUN(CC, CC) with eval = this partial sum at DEG + 1 would make
;;; the POLY form one citation.  (2) The bound hypotheses are |f| <= M on the TRACE of the
;;; circle (Cauchy's estimates) or on all of CC (Liouville); M is not assumed nonnegative (it
;;; is, being a bound of |f|).  (3) The disc hypotheses are those of cauchy-integral-formula.scm:
;;; f holomorphic on u, B(c, s) inside u, 0 < r < s.  (4) The binder of the polynomial's
;;; coefficient lambda is k; the coefficient function is ciep_, the degree's predecessor ciem_.
;;;
;;; NOTHING asserted, no definition.  Helper prefix cie- (the cif- helpers of
;;; cauchy-integral-formula.scm copied: a helper is local to its file); theorem binders cie*_
;;; and the binders of the cited theorems where an instance must match.
;;; LOAD WINDOW: lo = theorem-library/cauchy-integral-formula (every theorem of it but
;;; cif-open-minus-point is cited: the latest is holomorphic-power-series-disc); also
;;; analytic-log-laws (taylor-coefficients-at, alg-zero-deriv-ball), analytic-from-integral
;;; (cauchy-estimate-from-formula, cauchy-kernel-series-absolute, aif-cont-*), nth-deriv-laws
;;; (nth-deriv-on-succ-apply), cc-exp (cc-exp-magnitude-imaginary).  hi: none.
;;; Tactics: the early kit only (dk-*, use-cases, use-induction, pbc, prop, crs, ineq).
;;; piece 1: open minus a point, Cauchy with an exceptional point on a convex set / disc
(define cie-nfm '(NF-METRIC-SPACE CC-NORMED-FIELD))
(define (cie-op? t op n) (and (pair? t) (eq? (car t) op) (= (length t) n)))
(define (cie-cont u f)
  (list 'FORALL 'rgy_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'rgy_ u)
    (list 'IS-CONTINUOUS-AT (list 'SUBSPACE-MS cie-nfm u) cie-nfm f 'rgy_))))
(define (cie-imps hyps body)
  (if (null? hyps) body (list 'IMPLIES (car hyps) (cie-imps (cdr hyps) body))))
(define (cie-all vars body)
  (if (null? vars) body (list 'FORALL (car vars) (cie-all (cdr vars) body))))
(define (cie-and! a b)
  (let* ((f (list 'AND a b)))
    (if (not (dk-asm? f)) (dk-have! f (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!))))
    f))
(define (cie-pz z) (list 'DIFFERENCE 'CC (list 'SINGLETON z)))

(define (cie-rr! t)
  (let* ((typ (list 'IN t 'RR)))
    (cond ((dk-asm? typ) typ)
          ((eqv? t 0) (fact 'rr-zero-in) typ)
          ((eqv? t 1) (fact 'rr-one-in) typ)
          ((eq? t 'PI) (dk-split-all! (list (dk-cite! 'pi-pos))) typ)
          ((number? t) (dk-have! typ (lambda () (arith))) typ)
          ((dk-asm? (list 'IN t 'NN)) (fact 'nn-in-rr t) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'succ 2) (cie-nn! t) (fact 'nn-in-rr t) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '* 3) (cie-rr! (cadr t)) (cie-rr! (caddr t)) (fact 'rr-mul-in-rr (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '+ 3) (cie-rr! (cadr t)) (cie-rr! (caddr t)) (fact 'rr-add-in-rr (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '- 3) (cie-rr! (cadr t)) (cie-rr! (caddr t)) (fact 'rr-sub-in-rr (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '- 2) (cie-rr! (cadr t)) (fact 'rr-neg-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'magnitude 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (fact 'cc-magnitude-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'real-part 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (fact 'real-part-in-rr (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'imag-part 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (fact 'imag-part-in-rr (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'abs 2) (cie-rr! (cadr t)) (fact 'rr-abs-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'recip 2)
           (cie-rr! (cadr t))
           (if (not (dk-asm? (list 'NOT (list '= (cadr t) 0))))
               (if (dk-asm? (list '< 0 (cadr t)))
                   (fact 'rr-pos-ne-zero (cadr t))
                   (error "cie-rr!: land the non-vanishing first" (expression->string (cadr t)))))
           (cie-and! (list 'IN (cadr t) 'RR) (list 'NOT (list '= (cadr t) 0)))
           (fact 'rr-recip-closed (cadr t))
           typ)
          (#t (dk-real! t) typ))))
(define (cie-nn! t)
  (let* ((typ (list 'IN t 'NN)))
    (cond ((dk-asm? typ) typ)
          ((eqv? t 0) (fact 'nn-zero-in) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'succ 2) (cie-nn! (cadr t)) (fact 'nn-succ-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          (#t (dk-type! t 'NN)))))
(define (cie-cc! t)
  (let* ((typ (list 'IN t 'CC)))
    (cond ((dk-asm? typ) typ)
          ((eqv? t 0) (fact 'cc-zero-in) typ)
          ((eqv? t +i) (fact 'cc-i-in) typ)
          ((or (and (number? t) (real? t)) (eq? t 'PI) (dk-asm? (list 'IN t 'RR)) (dk-asm? (list 'IN t 'NN))
               (cie-op? t 'succ 2)
               (cie-op? t 'magnitude 2) (cie-op? t 'real-part 2) (cie-op? t 'imag-part 2))
           (cie-rr! t) (fact 'rr-subset-cc t) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '- 3) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (cie-cc! (caddr t)) (fact 'cc-sub-in-cc (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '- 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (fact 'cc-neg-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '+ 3) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (cie-cc! (caddr t))
           (cie-and! (list 'IN (cadr t) 'CC) (list 'IN (caddr t) 'CC)) (fact 'cc-add-closed (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t '* 3) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (cie-cc! (caddr t))
           (cie-and! (list 'IN (cadr t) 'CC) (list 'IN (caddr t) 'CC)) (fact 'cc-mul-closed (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'power 3) (cie-cc! (cadr t)) (cie-nn! (caddr t))
           (cie-and! (list 'IN (cadr t) 'CC) (list 'IN (caddr t) 'NN)) (fact 'power-typing-nonneg (cadr t) (caddr t)) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'CC-EXP 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t))
           (dk-split-all! (list (dk-cite! 'cc-exp-converges (cadr t)))) typ)
          ((cie-op? t 'recip 2) (cie-cc! (cadr t))
           (if (not (dk-asm? (list 'NOT (list '= (cadr t) 0))))
               (error "cie-cc!: land the non-vanishing first" (expression->string (cadr t))))
           (cie-and! (list 'IN (cadr t) 'CC) (list 'NOT (list '= (cadr t) 0)))
           (fact 'cc-recip-closed (cadr t)) typ)
          (#t (dk-type! t 'CC)))))

;;; y in CC \ {z}: land y in CC, y /= z, y - z /= 0
(define (cie-sub-nz! y z)
  (let* ((nz (list 'NOT (list '= (list '- y z) 0))))
    (dk-have! nz
      (lambda ()
        (di)
        (dk-cite! 'cc-sub-zero-eq y z)
        (ai (dk-ctx-form (list 'NOT (list '= y z))))))
    nz))
(define (cie-steps . thunks)
  ;; run THUNKS in order while the leaf focused at the start stays open
  (let* ((leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
    (let loop ((ts thunks))
      (if (and (pair? ts) (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)))
          (begin ((car ts)) (loop (cdr ts)))))))
(define (cie-pz-open! z y)
  (let* ((iff (dk-cite! 'cc-punctured-membership z y)))
    (cie-steps
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'IN y 'CC) (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list 'IN y (cie-pz z))))))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '= y z)) (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list 'IN y (cie-pz z))))))
      (lambda () (cie-sub-nz! y z)))))
(define (cie-pz-in! z y)
  (let* ((iff (dk-cite! 'cc-punctured-membership z y)))
    (dk-have! (list 'IN y (cie-pz z))
      (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list 'IN y 'CC) (list 'NOT (list '= y z)))))))
;;; the punctured plane: open (both spellings), a set
(define (cie-pz-setup! z)
  (let* ((d (cie-pz z)))
    (fact 'nf-cc-is-metric-space)
    (dk-cite! 'cc-punctured-open z)
    (let* ((iff (dk-cite! 'cc-ms-open-iff d)))
      (dk-have! (list 'IS-OPEN cie-nfm d) (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list 'IS-OPEN 'CC-MS d)))))
    (fact 'cc-is-set)
    (dk-cite! 'difference-set 'CC (list 'SINGLETON z))
    (dk-cite! 'cc-open-subset-cc d)))
;;; (cie-lam-typ! LAM DOM TYPER) -- LAM in FUN(DOM, CC); TYPER of the eigenvariable
(define (cie-lam-typ! lam dom pre)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN lam (list 'FUN dom 'CC))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-type! (lambda ()
                      (let* ((v (dk-di-var!)) (leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
                        (cie-steps
                          (lambda () (pre v))
                          (lambda () (if (dk--redex? (dk-goal)) (dk-lam-b!)))
                          (lambda () (if (not (dk-asm? (dk-goal))) (cie-cc! (cadr (dk-goal)))))
                          (lambda () (ass)))))))))
;;; detach an implication whose antecedent THUNK proves
(define (cie-detach! imp thunk)
  (if (and (pair? imp) (eq? (car imp) 'IMPLIES))
      (begin (dk-have! (cadr imp) thunk)
             (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (detach! imp))))
      imp))
(define (cie-only-prop! . fs) (if (apply dk-only! fs) (prop)))
(define (cie-lam-b-if!) (if (dk--redex? (dk-goal)) (dk-lam-b!)))
;;; subst, then ass on the SAME leaf unless the subst closed it
(define (cie-subst-ass! eq)
  (let* ((leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
    (subst eq)
    (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)) (ass))))
;;; 2 pi i: in CC and non-zero, its reciprocal in CC
(define cie-tpi '(* (* 2 PI) +i))
(define (cie-tpi!)
  (cie-rr! '(* 2 PI))
  (dk-have! '(< 0 (* 2 PI)) (lambda () (dk-ineq! '(< 0 PI))))
  (dk-cite! 'rr-pos-ne-zero '(* 2 PI))
  (cie-cc! '(* 2 PI))
  (fact 'cc-i-in)
  (dk-have! '(NOT (= +i 0))
    (lambda ()
      (di)
      (fact 'cc-i-squared)
      (dk-have! '(= (* 0 0) -1) (lambda () (subst '(= 0 +i)) (ass)))
      (dk-have! '(NOT (= (* 0 0) -1)) (lambda () (arith)))
      (ai '(NOT (= (* 0 0) -1)))))
  (dk-cite! 'cc-mul-nonzero '(* 2 PI) +i)
  (cie-cc! cie-tpi)
  (cie-cc! (list 'recip cie-tpi))
  (cie-and! (list 'IN cie-tpi 'CC) (list 'NOT (list '= cie-tpi 0)))
  (dk-cite! 'cc-recip-inverse cie-tpi))
;;; x in CC, c in CC, s in RR, |x - c| < s in context: land x in BALL(CC-MS, c, s)
(define (cie-in-ball! x c s)
  (let* ((m (list 'magnitude (list '- x c))))
    (fact 'cc-is-metric-space)
    (dk-have! '(== (PTS CC-MS) CC) (lambda () (slot 'PTS) (qrfl)))
    (dk-have! (list 'IN x '(PTS CC-MS)) (lambda () (subst '(= (PTS CC-MS) CC)) (ass)))
    (dk-have! (list 'IN c '(PTS CC-MS)) (lambda () (subst '(= (PTS CC-MS) CC)) (ass)))
    (cie-rr! m)
    (dk-cite! 'cc-ms-dist c x)
    (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-sub-sym c x)
    (dk-have! (list '<= (list '(DIST CC-MS) c x) m)
      (lambda ()
        (subst (list '= (list '(DIST CC-MS) c x) (list 'magnitude (list '- c x))))
        (if (not (equal? c x)) (subst (list '= (list 'magnitude (list '- c x)) m)))
        (dk-ineq!)))
    (let* ((cj (list 'AND (list 'IN x '(PTS CC-MS)) (list 'AND (list 'IN m 'RR) (list 'AND (list 'IN s 'RR)
                (list 'AND (list '<= (list '(DIST CC-MS) c x) m) (list '< m s)))))))
      (dk-have! cj (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
      (dk-cite! 'ball-mem-from-le 'CC-MS c x m s))))
;;; subst EQ in a == goal, then qrfl on the same leaf unless the subst closed it
(define (cie-subst-qrfl! eq)
  (let* ((leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
    (subst eq)
    (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)) (qrfl))))
;;; x in BALL(CC-MS, c, r) in context: land x in CC and |x - c| < r; return the latter
(define (cie-ball-open! c r x)
  ;; x in BALL(CC-MS, c, r) in context: land x in CC and |x - c| < r (stops early when a
  ;; landing closes the focus leaf, the claim being the goal)
  (let* ((dcx (list '(DIST CC-MS) c x))
         (mag (list 'magnitude (list '- c x)))
         (mag2 (list 'magnitude (list '- x c)))
         (cj  (list 'AND (list 'IN x '(PTS CC-MS)) (list 'AND (list '<= dcx r) (list 'NOT (list '= dcx r))))))
    (cie-steps
      (lambda () (fact 'cc-is-metric-space))
      (lambda () (let* ((iff (dk-cite! 'ball-membership 'CC-MS c r x)))
                   (dk-have! cj (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list 'IN x (list 'BALL 'CC-MS c r)))))))
      (lambda () (dk-split-all! (list (dk-ctx-form cj))))
      (lambda () (dk-have! '(== (PTS CC-MS) CC) (lambda () (slot 'PTS) (qrfl))))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'IN x 'CC) (lambda () (subst '(= CC (PTS CC-MS))) (ass))))
      (lambda () (dk-cite! 'cc-ms-dist c x))
      (lambda () (cie-rr! mag))
      (lambda () (cie-rr! mag2))
      (lambda () (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-sub-sym c x))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= mag r) (list 'NOT (list '= mag r)))
                   (lambda () (subst (list '= mag dcx)) (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!))))
      (lambda () (dk-cite! 'rr-le-ne-lt mag r))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list '< mag2 r) (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list '< mag r) (list '= mag mag2))))))))

(define (cie-subst-sym e from to)
  (cond ((eq? e from) to)
        ((pair? e) (cons (cie-subst-sym (car e) from to) (cie-subst-sym (cdr e) from to)))
        (#t e)))
;;; a point x of the trace, the trace already known inside CC \ {c} (and CC \ {z} ...):
;;; land x in CC, x /= c, x - c /= 0 (the same for each z in ZS)
(define (cie-tpt! x . zs)
  (cie-steps
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T (cie-pz 'c) x))
    (lambda () (cie-pz-open! 'c x))
    (lambda () (for-each (lambda (z) (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T (cie-pz z) x) (cie-pz-open! z x)) zs))))
(define (cie-dump-open!)
  (for-each (lambda (l) (display "\n;; OPEN: ") (display (expression->string (dk-goal-of l)))) (dk-open-leaves)))
(define (cie-center-in-ball! a r)
  ;; a in CC, r in RR, 0 < r: land a in BALL(CC-MS, a, r) (which also certifies the ball DEFINED)
  (let* ((d (list '- a a)) (m (list 'magnitude d)))
    (cie-rr! m)
    (cie-cc! d)
    (dk-have! (list '= d 0) (lambda () (crs)))
    (let ((iff (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-zero-iff d)))
      (dk-have! (list '= m 0) (lambda () (cie-only-prop! iff (list '= d 0)))))
    (dk-have! (list '< m r) (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list '= m 0) (list '< 0 r))))
    (cie-in-ball! a a r)))

(define (cie-R c) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifv_ (cie-pz c) (list 'recip (list '- 'cifv_ c))))
(define (cie-S c) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifv_ (cie-pz c) (list '- 'cifv_ c)))
(define (cie-P c n) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifv_ (cie-pz c) (list 'power (list 'recip (list '- 'cifv_ c)) n)))
(define (cie-sq-recip w c) (list '* (list 'recip (list '- w c)) (list 'recip (list '- w c))))
(define (cie-pd-goal j)
  (list 'FORALL 'cifc_ (list 'IMPLIES '(IN cifc_ CC)
    (list 'FORALL 'cifw_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'cifw_ (cie-pz 'cifc_))
      (list 'IS-DIFF-ON 'CC-NORMED-FIELD (cie-pz 'cifc_) (cie-P 'cifc_ (list 'succ j)) 'cifw_
            (list '* (list '- (list 'succ j)) (list 'power (list 'recip (list '- 'cifw_ 'cifc_)) (list 'succ (list 'succ j))))))))))
(define (cie-pow-succ! a n)
  (cie-cc! a) (cie-nn! n)
  (cie-and! (list 'IN a 'CC) (list 'IN n 'NN))
  (dk-cite! 'power-succ a n))
(define (cie-carr-typ! lam d)
  (fact 'cc-nf-carr)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN lam (list 'FUN d '(CARR CC-NORMED-FIELD)))
    (lambda () (subst '(== (CARR CC-NORMED-FIELD) CC)) (ass))))
(define cie-tp '(* 2 PI))
(define cie-I (list 'CCINT 0 cie-tp))
(define cie-C '(CIRCLE-PATH c r))
(define cie-Cd '(CIRCLE-DERIV c r))
(define cie-T (list 'TRACE cie-C 0 cie-tp))
(define (cie-kern z) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'wnw_ (cie-pz z) (list 'recip (list '- 'wnw_ z))))
(define (cie-in-I! v)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN v cie-I)
    (lambda () (mac 'ccint-membership)
               (dk-conj-close! (lambda () (if (dk-asm? (dk-goal)) (ass) (dk-ineq! (list '< 0 cie-tp) '(< 0 PI))))))))
(define (cie-circle-basics!)
  (fact 'rr-zero-in)
  (cie-rr! cie-tp)
  (dk-have! (list '< 0 cie-tp) (lambda () (dk-ineq! '(< 0 PI))))
  (dk-cite! 'circle-is-road 'c 'r)
  (fact 'is-road-is-path cie-C cie-Cd 0 cie-tp)
  (fact 'is-path-in-fun cie-C 0 cie-tp)
  (dk-cite! 'trace-subset-cc cie-C 0 cie-tp))
(define (cie-circ-pt! y)
  ;; y in the trace of the circle (c, r in context, 0 < r): y in CC, |y - c| = r,
  ;; r <= |y - c|, y /= c, y - c /= 0, y in CC \ {c}
  (let* ((m (list 'magnitude (list '- y 'c))))
    (cie-steps
      (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'CC y))
      (lambda () (dk-cite! 'circle-trace-magnitude 'c 'r y))
      (lambda () (cie-rr! m))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list '<= 'r m) (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list '= m 'r)))))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '= y 'c))
          (lambda ()
            (di)
            (dk-have! (list '= m 0)
              (lambda () (subst (list '= y 'c))
                         (dk-have! '(= (- c c) 0) (lambda () (crs)))
                         (subst '(= (- c c) 0))
                         (fact 'cc-magnitude-zero)
                         (ass)))
            (dk-absurd! (list 'IN m 'RR) '(IN r RR) (list '= m 0) (list '= m 'r) '(< 0 r)))))
      (lambda () (cie-sub-nz! y 'c))
      (lambda () (cie-pz-in! 'c y)))))
(define (cie-circ-not-z! y)
  ;; y in the trace, |z - c| < r: y /= z, y in CC \ {z}
  (cie-steps
    (lambda ()
      (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '= y 'z))
        (lambda ()
          (di)
          (dk-have! '(= (magnitude (- z c)) r)
            (lambda () (subst (list '= 'z y)) (ass)))
          (cie-rr! '(magnitude (- z c)))
          (dk-absurd! '(IN (magnitude (- z c)) RR) '(IN r RR) '(= (magnitude (- z c)) r) '(< (magnitude (- z c)) r)))))
    (lambda () (cie-sub-nz! y 'z))
    (lambda () (cie-pz-in! 'z y))))
(define (cie-Hk g k)
  (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aiw_ cie-T (list '* (list g 'aiw_) (list 'power '(recip (- aiw_ c)) (list 'succ k)))))
(define (cie-LI f) (list 'LINE-INT f cie-C cie-Cd 0 cie-tp))
(define (cie-trace-in-pz! p)
  (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET cie-T (cie-pz p))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (subset-by-element!)) (leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
        (cie-circ-pt! y)
        (if (eq? p 'z) (cie-circ-not-z! y))
        (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)) (ass))))))
(define (cie-kern-setup! p)
  (let* ((dd (cie-pz p)) (k (cie-kern p)))
    (dk-cite! 'winding-integrand-holomorphic p)
    (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-in-fun dd k)
    (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-continuous dd k)
    (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-open dd k)
    (dk-cite! 'cc-open-subset-cc dd)))
(define (cie-wi-g1! y) (dk-apply! cie-wi-gv y))
(define (cie-wi-typ-tt! lam)
  (cie-lam-typ! lam 'NN (lambda (v) (dk-apply! (dk-ctx-form cie-wi-at) v) (cie-cc! '(- z c)))))
(define cie-wi-wz '(WINDING (CIRCLE-PATH c r) (CIRCLE-DERIV c r) 0 (* 2 PI) z))
(define cie-wi-wc '(WINDING (CIRCLE-PATH c r) (CIRCLE-DERIV c r) 0 (* 2 PI) c))
(define (cie-f1 z) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T (list '* '(f cifw_) (list 'recip (list '- 'cifw_ z)))))
(define cie-cf-w '(DIFFERENCE u (SINGLETON z)))
(define cie-cf-bl '(BALL CC-MS c cifs_))
(define (cie-cf-w-pt! x)
  ;; x in W: x in u, x in CC, x /= z, x - z /= 0, x in CC \ {z}
  (let* ((dm (dk-cite! 'difference-membership 'u '(SINGLETON z) x))
        (sm (dk-cite! 'singleton-membership 'z x)))
    (cie-steps
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'IN x 'u) (lambda () (cie-only-prop! dm (list 'IN x cie-cf-w)))))
      (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd 'u 'CC x))
      (lambda () (fact 'membership-implies-sethood x 'CC))
      (lambda () (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '= x 'z))
                   (lambda () (cie-only-prop! dm sm (list 'IN x cie-cf-w) (list 'IN x 'SET)))))
      (lambda () (cie-sub-nz! x 'z))
      (lambda () (cie-pz-in! 'z x)))))
(define cie-cf-h (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifx_ cie-cf-w '(* (- (f cifx_) (f z)) (recip (- cifx_ z)))))
(define cie-cf-g1 (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifx_ cie-cf-w '(- (f cifx_) (f z))))
(define cie-cf-k (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'hbx_ cie-cf-w '(- (f z))))
(define cie-cf-rf (list 'RESTRICT 'f cie-cf-w))
(define cie-cf-rk (list 'RESTRICT (cie-kern 'z) cie-cf-w))
(define cie-cf-g2 (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T '(* (- (f cifw_) (f z)) (recip (- cifw_ z)))))
(define (cie-cf-t-pt0! x)
  (cie-steps
    (lambda () (cie-circ-pt! x))
    (lambda () (cie-circ-not-z! x))
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'u x))
    (lambda () (fact 'membership-implies-sethood x 'CC))
    (lambda () (let* ((dm (dk-cite! 'difference-membership 'u '(SINGLETON z) x))
                     (sm (dk-cite! 'singleton-membership 'z x)))
                 (dk-have! (list 'IN x cie-cf-w)
                   (lambda () (cie-only-prop! dm sm (list 'IN x 'u) (list 'IN x 'SET) (list 'NOT (list '= x 'z)))))))))
(define (cie-cf-t-pt! x)
  (cie-steps
    (lambda () (cie-tpt! x 'z))
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'u x))
    (lambda () (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'f 'u 'CC x))
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T cie-cf-w x))))
(define cie-cf-f1 (cie-f1 'z))
(define cie-cf-kt (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T '(recip (- cifw_ z))))
(define cie-cf-f2 (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T '(* (f z) (recip (- cifw_ z)))))
(define cie-cf-lk (cie-LI (cie-kern 'z)))
(define cie-rf (list 'RESTRICT 'f cie-T))
(define (cie-f1r z) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aiw_ cie-T (list '* (list cie-rf 'aiw_) (list 'recip (list '- 'aiw_ z)))))
(define (cie-disc-setting!)
  (cie-center-in-ball! 'c 'cifs_)
  (cie-circle-basics!)
  (dk-have! '(<= 0 r) (lambda () (dk-ineq! '(< 0 r))))
  (dk-cite! 'trace-is-set cie-C 0 cie-tp)
  (fact 'subset-refl cie-T)
  (dk-cite! 'circle-path-closed 'c 'r)
  (fact 'nf-cc-is-metric-space)
  (fact 'nf-metric-carrier 'CC-NORMED-FIELD)
  (fact 'cc-nf-carr)
  (dk-have! (list '== (list 'PTS cie-nfm) 'CC)
    (lambda () (subst (list '== (list 'PTS cie-nfm) '(CARR CC-NORMED-FIELD))) (ass)))
  (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-in-fun 'u 'f)
  (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-open 'u 'f)
  (dk-cite! 'holomorphic-on-continuous 'u 'f)
  (dk-cite! 'cc-open-subset-cc 'u)
  (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET 'u (list 'PTS cie-nfm))
    (lambda () (subst (list '== (list 'PTS cie-nfm) 'CC)) (ass)))
  (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET cie-T '(BALL CC-MS c cifs_))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (subset-by-element!)) (leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
        (cie-circ-pt! y)
        (dk-have! (list '< (list 'magnitude (list '- y 'c)) 'cifs_)
          (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list '= (list 'magnitude (list '- y 'c)) 'r) '(< r cifs_))))
        (cie-in-ball! y 'c 'cifs_)
        (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)) (ass)))))
  (dk-cite! 'subset-trans cie-T '(BALL CC-MS c cifs_) 'u)
  (dk-cite! 'restrict-in-fun 'f 'u 'CC cie-T)
  (dk-have! (cie-cont cie-T cie-rf)
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (dk-di-var!)))
        (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'u y)
        (dk-apply! (dk-ctx-form (cie-cont 'u 'f)) y)
        (dk-cite! 'subspace-restrict-continuous-at cie-nfm 'u cie-T cie-nfm 'f y)
        (ass))))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'aix_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'aix_ cie-T) '(<= r (magnitude (- aix_ c)))))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (dk-di-var!)) (m (list 'magnitude (list '- y 'c))))
        (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'CC y)
        (dk-cite! 'circle-trace-magnitude 'c 'r y)
        (cie-rr! m)
        (dk-ineq! (list '= m 'r))))))
(define cie-disc-hyps
  '((HOLOMORPHIC-ON u f) (IN c CC) (IN cifs_ RR) (< 0 cifs_) (SUBSET (BALL CC-MS c cifs_) u)
    (IN r RR) (< 0 r) (< r cifs_)))
(define (cie-under-disc body)
  (list 'FORALL 'u (list 'FORALL 'f (list 'IMPLIES '(HOLOMORPHIC-ON u f)
    (list 'FORALL 'c (list 'IMPLIES '(IN c CC) (list 'FORALL 'cifs_ (list 'IMPLIES '(IN cifs_ RR) (list 'IMPLIES '(< 0 cifs_)
      (list 'IMPLIES '(SUBSET (BALL CC-MS c cifs_) u)
        (list 'FORALL 'r (list 'IMPLIES '(IN r RR) (list 'IMPLIES '(< 0 r) (list 'IMPLIES '(< r cifs_) body))))))))))))))
(define cie-kap (list 'recip cie-tpi))
(define cie-fr-f1 (cie-f1 'z))
(define cie-fr-kt (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T '(recip (- cifw_ z))))
(define (cie-fr-pt! x)
  (cie-steps
    (lambda () (cie-tpt! x 'z))
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'u x))
    (lambda () (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'f 'u 'CC x))))
(define (cie-h3 z)
  (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aitk_ 'NN
    (list '* (list '* cie-kap (cie-LI (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aiw_ cie-T
                                            (list '* (list cie-rf 'aiw_) (list 'power '(recip (- aiw_ c)) '(succ aitk_))))))
             (list 'power (list '- z 'c) 'aitk_))))
(define cie-formula-r
  (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES '(IN z CC) (list 'IMPLIES '(< (magnitude (- z c)) r)
    (list '= '(f z) (list '* cie-kap (cie-LI (cie-f1r 'z))))))))

(define (cie-subst-rfl! eq)
  (let ((leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
    (subst eq)
    (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf)) (rfl))))
;;; (E0) |i| = 1
(sp (make-wff '(= (magnitude +i) 1)))
(let* ((m '(magnitude +i)))
  (fact 'cc-i-in)
  (fact 'rr-one-in)
  (cie-rr! m)
  (fact 'cc-magnitude-nonneg '+i)
  (dk-have! '(<= 0 1) (lambda () (dk-ineq!)))
  (cie-and! '(IN +i CC) '(IN +i CC))
  (dk-have! (list '= (list '* m m) '(* 1 1)) (lambda () (crs)))
  (cie-and! (list 'IN m 'RR) '(IN 1 RR))
  (cie-and! (list '<= 0 m) '(<= 0 1))
  (dk-cite! 'sqrt-unique m 1)
  (ass))
(qed 'cc-magnitude-i)

;;; (E1) the length of the circle of radius r: 2 pi r
(sp (make-wff (list 'FORALL 'c (list 'IMPLIES '(IN c CC) (list 'FORALL 'r (list 'IMPLIES '(IN r RR) (list 'IMPLIES '(<= 0 r)
  (list '= (list 'ROAD-LENGTH cie-Cd 0 cie-tp) (list '* cie-tp 'r)))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(cie-rr! cie-tp)
(dk-have! (list '< 0 cie-tp) (lambda () (dk-ineq! '(< 0 PI))))
(fact 'rr-zero-in)
(cie-in-I! 0)
(cie-in-I! cie-tp)
(fact 'cc-magnitude-i)
(mac 'ROAD-LENGTH)
(let* ((lam (cadr (cadr (dk-goal))))
       (val! (lambda (y)
               ;; y in [0, 2 pi]: |CIRCLE-DERIV(c, r)(y)| = r, after unfolding
               (let* ((e (list 'CC-EXP (list '* '+i y))) (x (list '* 'r e)))
                 (fact 'ccint-elt-in-rr 0 cie-tp y)
                 (cie-cc! x)
                 (cie-and! '(IN +i CC) (list 'IN x 'CC))
                 (cie-and! '(IN r CC) (list 'IN e 'CC))
                 (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-mul '+i x)
                 (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-mul 'r e)
                 (dk-cite! 'cc-exp-magnitude-imaginary y)
                 (dk-cite! 'rr-magnitude-is-abs 'r)
                 (dk-cite! 'rr-abs-of-nonneg 'r)))))
  (fact 'rr-is-set)
  (fact 'ccint-subset-rr 0 cie-tp)
  (fact 'subclass-of-set-is-set cie-I 'RR)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'pay_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'pay_ cie-I) (list '== (list lam 'pay_) 'r)))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (dk-di-var!)))
        (val! y)
        (dk-lam-b!)
        (mac 'CIRCLE-DERIV)
        (dk-lam-b!)
        (let* ((e (list 'CC-EXP (list '* '+i y))) (x (list '* 'r e)))
          (subst (list '= (list 'magnitude (list '* '+i x)) (list '* '(magnitude +i) (list 'magnitude x))))
          (subst (list '= (list 'magnitude x) (list '* '(magnitude r) (list 'magnitude e))))
          (subst (list '= (list 'magnitude e) 1))
          (subst '(= (magnitude r) (abs r)))
          (subst '(= (abs r) r))
          (subst '(= (magnitude +i) 1))
          (dk-have! '(= (* 1 (* r 1)) r) (lambda () (crs)))
          (cie-subst-qrfl! '(= (* 1 (* r 1)) r))))))
  (dk-have! (list 'IN lam (list 'FUN cie-I 'RR))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-type!
        (lambda ()
          (let* ((y (dk-di-var!)) (leaf (proof-state-focus *ps*)))
            (dk-apply! (dk-ctx-form (list 'FORALL 'pay_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'pay_ cie-I) (list '== (list lam 'pay_) 'r)))) y)
            (cie-lam-b-if!)
            (if (not (sequent-node-grounded? leaf))
                (begin
                  (val! y)
                  (mac 'CIRCLE-DERIV)
                  (dk-lam-b!)
                  (cie-rr! (cadr (dk-goal)))
                  (ass)))))
        ass)))
  (let* ((cst (dk-cite! 'pw-int-const 0 cie-tp 'r lam)))
    (subst cst)
    (crs)))
(qed 'circle-road-length)

;;; (E2) |1/(2 pi i)| = 1/(2 pi)
(sp (make-wff (list '= (list 'magnitude cie-kap) (list 'recip cie-tp))))
(cie-tpi!)
(fact 'cc-magnitude-i)
(dk-cite! 'aif-magnitude-recip cie-tpi)
(subst (list '= (list 'magnitude cie-kap) (list 'recip (list 'magnitude cie-tpi))))
(cie-and! (list 'IN cie-tp 'CC) '(IN +i CC))
(subst (dk-cite! 'cc-magnitude-mul cie-tp '+i))
(subst (dk-cite! 'rr-magnitude-is-abs cie-tp))
(dk-have! (list '<= 0 cie-tp) (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list '< 0 cie-tp))))
(subst (dk-cite! 'rr-abs-of-nonneg cie-tp))
(subst '(= (magnitude +i) 1))
(dk-have! (list '= (list '* cie-tp 1) cie-tp) (lambda () (crs)))
(subst (list '= (list '* cie-tp 1) cie-tp))
(cie-and! (list 'IN cie-tp 'RR) (list 'NOT (list '= cie-tp 0)))
(dk-cite! 'rr-recip-closed cie-tp)
(rfl)
(qed 'cauchy-kernel-constant-magnitude)

;;; (E3) CAUCHY'S ESTIMATES (Prop 3.47 in the coefficient form): |f| <= M on the circle
;;; C(c, r) => the k-th coefficient of holomorphic-power-series-disc has modulus <= M r^-k
(define (cie-coef k)
  (list '* cie-kap (cie-LI (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aiw_ cie-T
                             (list '* (list cie-rf 'aiw_) (list 'power '(recip (- aiw_ c)) (list 'succ k)))))))
(define cie-bnd-h (list 'FORALL 'ciey_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'ciey_ cie-T) '(<= (magnitude (f ciey_)) ciebd_))))
(sp (make-wff (cie-under-disc
  (list 'FORALL 'ciebd_ (list 'IMPLIES '(IN ciebd_ RR) (list 'IMPLIES cie-bnd-h
    (list 'FORALL 'k (list 'IMPLIES '(IN k NN)
      (list '<= (list 'magnitude (cie-coef 'k)) '(* ciebd_ (power (recip r) k)))))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(cie-disc-setting!)
(cie-tpi!)
(define (cie-rf-bound!)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'aiy_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'aiy_ cie-T) (list '<= (list 'magnitude (list cie-rf 'aiy_)) 'ciebd_)))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((y (dk-di-var!)))
        (dk-apply! (dk-ctx-form cie-bnd-h) y)
        (dk-cite! 'restrict-apply 'f cie-T y)
        (cie-subst-ass! (list '== (list cie-rf y) (list 'f y)))))))
(cie-rf-bound!)
(let* ((est (dk-cite! 'cauchy-estimate-from-formula cie-T 'c 'r cie-rf cie-C cie-Cd 0 cie-tp 'ciebd_ cie-kap 'k))
       (rhs (caddr est))
       (q '(recip r)) (p '(power (recip r) k)))
  (dk-cite! 'circle-road-length 'c 'r)
  (dk-cite! 'cauchy-kernel-constant-magnitude)
  (fact 'rr-pos-ne-zero 'r)
  (cie-and! '(IN r RR) '(NOT (= r 0)))
  (dk-cite! 'rr-recip-closed 'r)
  (dk-cite! 'rr-recip-inverse 'r)
  (cie-and! (list 'IN cie-tp 'RR) (list 'NOT (list '= cie-tp 0)))
  (dk-cite! 'rr-recip-closed cie-tp)
  (dk-cite! 'rr-recip-inverse cie-tp)
  (fact 'power-real-closed q 'k)
  (dk-have! (list '= '(* ciebd_ (power (recip r) k)) rhs)
    (lambda ()
      (subst (list '= (list 'magnitude cie-kap) (list 'recip cie-tp)))
      (subst (list '= (list 'ROAD-LENGTH cie-Cd 0 cie-tp) (list '* cie-tp 'r)))
      (fact 'cc-i-in)
      (fact 'rr-subset-cc q)
      (subst (cie-pow-succ! q 'k))
      (let* ((pv (dk-name! p)) (a (dk-name! (list 'recip cie-tp))) (qv (dk-name! q)))
        (subst (list '= p pv))
        (subst (list '= (list 'recip cie-tp) a))
        (subst (list '= q qv))
        (dk-have! (list '= (list '* cie-tp a) 1) (lambda () (subst (list '= a (list 'recip cie-tp))) (ass)))
        (dk-have! (list '= (list '* 'r qv) 1) (lambda () (subst (list '= qv q)) (ass)))
        (let* ((e (list '= (list '* a (list '* (list '* cie-tp 'r) (list '* 'ciebd_ (list '* qv pv))))
                       (list '* (list '* (list '* cie-tp a) (list '* 'r qv)) (list '* 'ciebd_ pv)))))
          (dk-have! e (lambda () (crs)))
          (subst e)
          (subst (list '= (list '* cie-tp a) 1))
          (subst (list '= (list '* 'r qv) 1))
          (crs)))))
  (cie-subst-ass! (list '= '(* ciebd_ (power (recip r) k)) rhs)))
(qed 'cauchy-estimate-circle)

;;; (E4) the bound at the centre (k = 0): |f(c)| <= M when |f| <= M on the circle
(sp (make-wff (cie-under-disc
  (list 'FORALL 'ciebd_ (list 'IMPLIES '(IN ciebd_ RR) (list 'IMPLIES cie-bnd-h
    '(<= (magnitude (f c)) ciebd_)))))))
(dk-peel!)
(cie-disc-setting!)
(cie-tpi!)
(cie-pz-setup! 'c)
(cie-kern-setup! 'c)
(cie-trace-in-pz! 'c)
(cie-center-in-ball! 'c 'r)
(cie-cc! '(- c c))
(dk-have! '(= (- c c) 0) (lambda () (crs)))
(dk-congr! '(= (- c c) 0) (lambda (w) (list 'magnitude w)))
(fact 'cc-magnitude-zero)
(cie-rr! '(magnitude (- c c)))
(dk-have! '(< (magnitude (- c c)) r) (lambda () (dk-ineq! '(= (magnitude (- c c)) (magnitude 0)) '(= (magnitude 0) 0) '(< 0 r))))
(define cie-ce-i1 (cie-f1r 'c))
(define cie-ce-i0 (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'aiw_ cie-T (list '* (list cie-rf 'aiw_) (list 'power '(recip (- aiw_ c)) '(succ 0)))))
(define cie-ce-kt (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'cifw_ cie-T '(recip (- cifw_ c))))
(define (cie-ce-pt! x)
  (cie-steps
    (lambda () (cie-tpt! x))
    (lambda () (fact 'subset-mem-fwd cie-T 'u x))
    (lambda () (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'f 'u 'CC x))
    (lambda () (dk-cite! 'restrict-apply 'f cie-T x))))
(fact 'nn-zero-in)
(fact 'nn-succ-closed 0)
(cie-lam-typ! cie-ce-kt cie-T (lambda (v) (cie-ce-pt! v)))
(cie-lam-typ! cie-ce-i1 cie-T (lambda (v) (cie-ce-pt! v) (cie-lam-b-if!) (subst (list '== (list cie-rf v) (list 'f v)))))
(cie-lam-typ! cie-ce-i0 cie-T (lambda (v) (cie-ce-pt! v) (cie-lam-b-if!) (subst (list '== (list cie-rf v) (list 'f v)))))
(dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'aix_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'aix_ cie-T) (list '== (list cie-ce-kt 'aix_) (list (cie-kern 'c) 'aix_))))
  (lambda () (let* ((x (dk-di-var!))) (cie-ce-pt! x) (dk-lam-b!) (qrfl))))
(dk-cite! 'aif-cont-holo-restrict (cie-pz 'c) (cie-kern 'c) cie-T cie-ce-kt)
(dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'aix_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'aix_ cie-T) (list '== (list cie-ce-i1 'aix_) (list '* (list cie-rf 'aix_) (list cie-ce-kt 'aix_)))))
  (lambda () (let* ((x (dk-di-var!))) (cie-ce-pt! x) (dk-lam-b!) (qrfl))))
(dk-cite! 'aif-cont-product cie-T cie-rf cie-ce-kt cie-ce-i1)
(dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'wnx_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'wnx_ cie-T) (list '== (list cie-ce-i0 'wnx_) (list cie-ce-i1 'wnx_))))
  (lambda ()
    (let* ((x (dk-di-var!)) (ax (list 'recip (list '- x 'c))))
      (cie-ce-pt! x)
